    "text": "CONCLUDED\nLast Updated:\n8 hours ago\nTesla Stock Swings Ahead of SpaceX Open\nTesla is the other trillion-dollar company run by Musk.\nAhead of SpaceX trading, shares were bobbing up and down, but relatively stable for Tesla.\nTesla stock traded as high as $404.30 and as low as $391.90, before settling at $391.19, down 0.6%. The S&P 500 was up less than 0.1%.",
